        <mxCell id="d-notes" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;*1 The Supervisor brokers every step&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Collaborators never talk to each other directly; the Supervisor passes&lt;br&gt;the instructions and the results&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;*2 What the user experiences&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;One chat message completes several phases, and the intermediate&lt;br&gt;exchanges stay hidden" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 4;strokeColor=#232F3E;fillColor=#FFFFFF;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=4;fontSize=16;fontColor=#232F3E;" vertex="1" parent="1">
